{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "5e8b3b08895a5ac81c50b8b8e4b0f5b6fc7ec36d90a8e459365aee92911e809c", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-07 — Examiner/Marking Language"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "b8548726e5c9efd80aa8abdaa3acae025fa188f7f0f76ff0304a6d9be6d9a490", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues the marking language of the 4CH1 mark schemes as parsed in\nthe official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): the annotation lexicon (IGNORE,\nALLOW, ACCEPT, OWTTE, CSQ, DO NOT ALLOW) and the semantics each marker term carries.\nThe lexicon is read strictly off the parsed text — it is the board's own operating\nlanguage for examiners, preserved verbatim in the corpus. Every claim is carried on a\nbounded, locator-addressed excerpt from the run's evidence pack. Research artifact;\ncanonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "033a9a2e7a81e88ee06d5ea44b2ea6e9408ee04287e31d1b8e0a8f89af5013bf", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** the six-term annotation lexicon and its per-term semantics as printed on\nthe mark points.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C and 1CR papers of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** examiner-report language (EXM family — examiner sentiment\nsynthesised from mark schemes is a forbidden substitution), alternatives breadth\n(MS-04)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "41810737da064d9d8a35639bf3d44d12baf03ddcab739f53bf230b0622346dce", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe mark schemes speak in a compact, consistent marking language. IGNORE marks\ncontent that neither earns nor loses credit (clear for colourless); ALLOW admits\nformat latitude on the same point (red-brown/orange-brown for brown); ACCEPT admits\nchemically equivalent formulations (a reversible arrow; HO- for OH-); OWTTE waives\nwording while holding the chemistry; CSQ chains a point's credit onto an earlier\nanswer; and DO NOT WITHHOLDS credit for a named error. Reading the lexicon is\nreading the examiner's operating manual — and because it is preserved in the parsed\ncorpus, revision materials can quote the board's own terms rather than paraphrasing\nthem."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "82d3f4e10156e3f3f7c807622ac9a80741c7c92531b30782dd70fc6ad24ac5c0", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C and 1CR official extractions (82\nbounded line-window excerpts across the two files, locators preserved; marking\nlanguage cited verbatim). No examiner reports were consumed for this artifact; the\nexaminer-sentiment substitution is forbidden and was not made. No specimen material\nwas cited."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "e5ab6af7d9223ca86dffc2f5d7ea177c2294a4f420ec4dc8c1d7610994916416", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe lexicon covers the annotation terms visible in the pack's excerpt windows of two\n2019-06 papers; the corpus's later sessions share the declared extraction schema but\nlexicon drift is not audited here. Term frequency is not measured. No canonical\nplanes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-037", "content_sha256": "3db26ced8f8b84dfbfb04dc28c82de51b9f24628ab2d36b22258720eb2f040f1", "heading": "MS-037", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-037", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-037", "text": "### MS-037 — The six-term annotation lexicon\n\n**Claim:** the parsed mark schemes use a stable annotation lexicon — IGNORE, ALLOW,\nACCEPT, OWTTE, CSQ and DO NOT ALLOW — attached directly to mark points.\n**Evidence:** the displacement-observation scheme runs ALLOW, IGNORE and the point\nlines together — \"M1 brown/pink/pink-brown solid forms ALLOW red-brown /orange-brown\nIGNORE red or orange alone ... M2 solution turns colourless ALLOW solution becomes\npaler IGNORE clear\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 457-471).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-038", "content_sha256": "77b3aa55339bd9c027b0c664f5afc3bd52c9fd8ad8b82c6d397633cf5e0ebd2a", "heading": "MS-038", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-038", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-038", "text": "### MS-038 — IGNORE: non-scoring, non-penalised\n\n**Claim:** IGNORE voids named content without penalising the candidate.\n**Evidence:** \"IGNORE Fe if added to both sides of the equation\" on the ammonia\nequation (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 378-392); the stacked\nIGNORE notes on the displacement observation point — the parsed excerpt (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 463-477).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-039", "content_sha256": "6f9337bfb55992150975e91cb7154f9712ca6f14117fd80b87f15ec355b3b374", "heading": "MS-039", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-039", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-039", "text": "### MS-039 — ALLOW: format latitude on the required chemistry\n\n**Claim:** ALLOW admits variant renderings of the same chemical fact.\n**Evidence:** \"M1 brown/pink/pink-brown solid forms ALLOW red-brown /orange-brown\n... ALLOW precipitate for solid\" and \"M2 solution turns colourless ALLOW solution\nbecomes paler\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 457-471).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-040", "content_sha256": "ab857b032acdd5dcfd1b6db80f2b4a103c2d1c1408187adb2e425b236e4dff5f", "heading": "MS-040", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-040", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-040", "text": "### MS-040 — ACCEPT: chemically equivalent formulations\n\n**Claim:** ACCEPT admits alternative chemical notations and formulations of equal\nstanding.\n**Evidence:** \"N2 + 3H2 → 2NH3 ACCEPT reversible arrow\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 378-392); \"OH- ACCEPT HO-\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 119-133).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-041", "content_sha256": "b89108ab148ac77f7682e6915af78f07133c8dabc21ab6ea4a48b9b523759181", "heading": "MS-041", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-041", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-041", "text": "### MS-041 — Boundary enforcement: DO NOT ALLOW\n\n**Claim:** where a named error must void the mark, the scheme prints DO NOT ALLOW on\nthe point.\n**Evidence:** the chromatography method scheme's guard \"place the paper in the\nbeaker so DO NOT ALLOW M3 if\" alongside its point lines (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 171-185).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-07", "chunk_id": "MS-07:rec:MS-042", "content_sha256": "37185a2c2960381511e24a6c5893b05b456c6242dfa866e46db1d52f94dbb92a", "heading": "MS-042", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-042", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-042", "text": "### MS-042 — Consequential marking: CSQ and OWTTE\n\n**Claim:** CSQ chains credit onto earlier answers and OWTTE waives wording; both\nride on the point lines.\n**Evidence:** \"lithium bromide / LiBr Mark CSQ on (a) and\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 184-198); the parsed excerpt\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 171-185).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
